# Per-machine agent-runtime state. Never repository content: machine-specific,
# never tracked in this repository's history, and read by no build or gate.
# Declared here rather than in a per-user global ignore file because the gate's
# clean-baseline check deliberately disables user-global excludes so that
# untracked-state enforcement is deterministic and reviewable in-tree
# (scripts/owned_process_tree.ps1, Invoke-RMQCheckedGit).
